<title>NORWAY: PGS Q1 pre-tax profits up.</title>
<headline>PGS Q1 pre-tax profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (millions of U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating income	     94.3	  vs	  87.9</p>
<p> Operating result	     14.7	  vs	   7.0</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		  9.9	  vs	   4.0</p>
<p> After-tax result		3.5	  vs	   2.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore services and seismic company is Petroleum Geo-Services ASA. Eight analysts polled by Reuters had forecast pre-tax profits of 41 million crowns. The company has headquarters in Oslo and Houston, Texas.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
